  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your strikes from below pierce the soft underbelly of your enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Low Blow<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on critical hit confirmation rolls increases by 1 for each size category the target is larger than you. In addition, you can use your ability to reroll a critical hit confirmation roll against a larger creature more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each additional use.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc179\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
